aetherhaven.festival.banner.started.subtitle=The festival begins
aetherhaven.festival.ended={festival} is over. The square is back to normal.
aetherhaven.festival.needSquare=Your town needs a finished festival square before festivals can happen.
aetherhaven.festival.square.protected=The town keeps the festival square just so. You can use and pick things here, but you cannot build or dig.

